cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas, please cite it as below, together with the ISC-GEM catalogue and USGS ComCat."
title: "Global Seismicity Atlas"
abstract: "An open, reproducible world map of earthquake-catalogue statistics: completeness (Mc), Gutenberg-Richter b-value with 95 % intervals and quality codes, ISC-GEM vs ComCat consistency, and Omori-Utsu parameters for major sequences. Not a forecast and not a hazard map."
type: software
version: "0.3.1"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: MIT
